{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121807","id":4982485782,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc72oTMn","number":121807,"title":"Account for trailing spaces when converting to tabs","user":{"login":"TiesDO","id":118288338,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwzv0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118288338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO","html_url":"https://github.com/TiesDO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-26T20:54:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T21:02:07Z","closed_at":"2026-08-06T20:58:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121807","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121807.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121807.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to close https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/35007.\r\n\r\nWhen converting a file with space indentation to tab indentation it would be left in a broken state if not all space indentation was a multiple of `indent_size`.\r\n\r\nIn order to at least solve this `CodeEdit::convert_indent` now accounts for a possibility that there are 'trailing_spaces' and instead of ignoring them it will now convert those to a single `\\t` as well.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# before this PR\r\nfunc test():\r\n    if true:        # 4 spaces (would convert to '\\t')\r\n     print(\"oops\")  # 5 spaces (would convert to '\\t ' <- extra space)\r\n\r\n# after this PR\r\nfunc test():\r\n    if true:           # 4 spaces (converts to '\\t')\r\n        print(\"oops\")  # 5 spaces (converts to '\\t\\t')\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- I've kept the combined logic of tabs and spaces to keep the change minimal. Although I feel it would be best to have a separate function for to_spaces and to_tabs.\r\n- The `String` class already protects against out of bounds reads, but I've kept the unit test to highlight that whitespace only lines are included in this conversion. I think it makes more sense to collapse whitespace only lines to `\\n` instead.\r\n- There is no guard blocking this conversion logic on invalid files, if the file isn't valid `CodeEdit::validate_script` suggests that we can check the script before converting, but I don't quite know how to follow the signal path here.\r\n\r\n## AI DISCLOSURE\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.","closed_by":{"login":"TiesDO","id":118288338,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwzv0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118288338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO","html_url":"https://github.com/TiesDO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}